Output src/generated/even_and_odd.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/even_and_odd.txt"
Enter
Show

Type ":"
Type "g"
Type "/"
Type "^"
Type "$"
Type "/"
Type "d"
Enter
Type ":"
Type "g"
Type "/"
Type "["
Type "1"
Type "3"
Type "5"
Type "7"
Type "9"
Type "]"
Type "$"
Type "/"
Type "m"
Type "$"
Enter
Type ":"
Type "1"
Type ","
Type "5"
Type "0"
Type "j"
Enter
Type ":"
Type "2"
Type ","
Type "$"
Type "j"
Enter

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s